Z||000013||pollock||12-21-2000||11:54 AM||||AMEN, Dan-o..<P>As the proud owner of a mustang that bears a [very] faint resemblance to the one in the movie, i am a big fan.  The Shelby was cooler than any 3 of the most exotic cars in that movie.  All the custom stuff on it just made the car.  Not to mention, the sound of that engine is quite authentic.  It's the sound that makes my jeans fit tight.  <P>But please, if you're going to mention m'lady Angelina, please don't remind us of billy bob.  I just can't handle it.  An interesting tidbit:  a survey in "JANE" magazine ranked her very high on the list of people their readers want to get with.  <P>PS, that's a women's magazine.  oh, yeah.<P>remember when she first rolls out on that creeper, all greasy and wearing a poopey suit?  That was awesome!!!<p>[This message has been edited by pollock (edited 12-21-2000).]||||reg||1
